---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
---
{% from "partials/project-card.njk" import card %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="hero-kicker"><span class="muted">$</span> whoami</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">{{ site.author }}</h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
    <p class="hero-blurb">
      I design interfaces and the systems behind them. This is where I keep my
      case studies, the side projects I build for fun, and notes on the craft.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/projects/">view projects</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/blog/">read the blog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-title"><span class="muted">//</span> selected work</h2>
      <a class="section-link" href="/projects/">all projects &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-grid">
      {% for project in collections.projects %}
        {% if loop.index <= 3 %}{{ card(project) }}{% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-title"><span class="muted">//</span> latest writing</h2>
      <a class="section-link" href="/blog/">all posts &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        <li class="post-list-item">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
            <span class="post-list-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-title"><span class="muted">//</span> about</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="home-about">
      <p>
        The friction worth fixing is usually in the unglamorous parts of a
        product: admin tools, CMS workflows, and internal product flows that
        never make the hero section of a case study. That is where I do my
        best work, and where most teams have the most to gain.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I am not designing, I am tinkering with mechanical keyboards,
        playing too many board games, or experimenting in the kitchen.
      </p>
      <p>
        Always open to a good conversation about what's next.
        <a href="mailto:hello@jon-morris.com">Email me</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-panels">
      <article class="home-panel">
        <h3 class="home-panel-title">clients I've worked with</h3>
        <ul class="home-list home-list--clients">
          {% for client in site.clients %}
          <li>{{ client }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="home-panel">
        <h3 class="home-panel-title">capabilities</h3>
        <ul class="home-list">
          {% for capability in site.capabilities %}
          <li>{{ capability }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
